  "schedule": {
    "rule": "After a successful Claude read the next read is due at the earlier of five minutes and the next reset still ahead of that read. A reset at or before the read, or an unknown one, is ignored. A failure keeps its own backoff: a rate limit doubles from sixty seconds to a fifteen minute cap and honours Retry-After up to seven days; a refusal waits a day whatever Retry-After says. The desktop adds its own small jitter after the success deadline.",
